363
00:13:11.866 --> 00:13:13.000
<v GELVIN>In Opelousas.

364
00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:13.379
<v VICTORIAN>[Agrees].

365
00:13:13.379 --> 00:13:17.168
But they grew up and went to school in Mossville.

366
00:13:17.168 --> 00:13:17.926
<v GELVIN>Got you.

367
00:13:17.926 --> 00:13:24.368
Is there anything else that you’d like to talk about in terms of Mossville being your home,

368
00:13:24.368 --> 00:13:30.432
