369
00:13:30.432 --> 00:13:31.189
<v VICTORIAN>Oh, yeah.

370
00:13:31.189 --> 00:13:33.842
I miss already some of thems gone.

371
00:13:33.842 --> 00:13:35.358
I miss them already.

372
00:13:35.358 --> 00:13:36.116
It’s something.

373
00:13:36.116 --> 00:13:38.389
