379
00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:49.632
<v GELVIN>Got you.

380
00:13:49.632 --> 00:13:50.579
Well thank you . . .

381
00:13:50.579 --> 00:13:51.211
<v VICTORIAN>You’re welcome.

382
00:13:51.211 --> 00:13:54.053
<v GELVIN>Thank you so much for talking to us today.

383
00:13:54.053 --> 00:13:55.000
<v VICTORIAN>Thank you.

384
00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:55.516
<v GELVIN>I really appreciate it.

385
00:13:55.516 --> 00:13:56.806
<v VICTORIAN>I’m glad I could share some stuff with you guys.

386
00:13:56.806 --> 00:13:57.839
<v GELVIN>Thank you so much for sharing your stories.

